      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RED HOT PENNY (2) is progressing well and looks close to another win after hitting the frame last run (19.86) at Capalaba. Form at the trip sound including two wins. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Rates highly and will give a great sight. JANE'S MAGIC (8) comes into this as a quickest on the card winner last time at this track, scoring by 6 lengths (21.74). Bold showing expected again. PSIONIC PROWESS (1) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by half a length at this track in a handy 25.87 beating Bush Bouquet. Yet to miss the placings from three starts out of this box. Bold showing expected again. BAREFOOT RASCAL (7) raced on the pace and got home last start. Right in the mix.",
